# Trivy scan suppressions for false positives

# AVD-KSV-0109: False positive - "bypass" is a boolean configuration flag, not a secret
# ConfigMap contains admin.bypass boolean for enabling admin group bypass feature
# This is documented configuration, not sensitive data
AVD-KSV-0109

# --- grafana/tempo: whole-module advisories with no reachable fix (#6).
# We import only github.com/grafana/tempo/pkg/traceql (the TraceQL parser, in
# enforcer_traceql.go). Both CVEs are in Tempo's server components, which are neither
# imported nor run here. Their only fixes are Tempo v2.x releases, and Tempo is a
# v1-path Go module (no /v2), so no fixed version exists as a Go module version; the Go
# vulnerability database notes it could not map these versions and flags the whole
# module. The prometheus/prometheus CVEs that used to be listed here are fixed:
# the replace pin was removed and prometheus is now v0.312.0.
# Reassess if we import Tempo server/storage packages, or if grafana/tempo moves to a
# /v2 module path.
CVE-2026-21728
CVE-2026-28377
